よ。銀行の先進性と証券の後進性がすごい開きがあってびっくりしました。","ts":"1617276649.282700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H7kj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b374ca65-6b57-4883-8c78-22a3a220421d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"2段階別パスワードは権限分離としてはいいけど、防御手段としては強度はあまりあがらない、だったか?","ts":"1617276632.282400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hTwK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e67fa30c-a7ba-4876-bcaf-ddbaac6e3641","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"銀行のほうは、アプリ側への確認要求(知識と所有の2FA)してくれるのにね","ts":"1617276596.280900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ypS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"edd24612-1d9d-47d4-ac43-3efdd04d0c15","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あれもそうですね...取引パスワードはあるから、多少マシとはいえ","ts":"1617276529.280300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nSmn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"579DD4FF-8EDB-4CE2-9A05-6A1BDC7380FB","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"最近作ったSBI証券がMFA対応していなくてがっかりした。","ts":"1617276469.279800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vqw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"870555e4-e18e-474a-bd5a-d6ed2e2994da","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"リセットで使えないのは1回前までくらいにして、長いのにするように制限つけてほしいですね...(最低12文字とか)","ts":"1617274764.278700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=6b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e408eb6-3f49-46ef-bb14-041204dbbef3","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"おまけで言うなら楽天はパスワードを忘れた時に出てくる秘密の質問でパスワードがリセットされて同じのを使えないからユーザはまた今度は忘れない短いパスワードを使おうとするんですよね。めっちゃ悪循環。","ts":"1617274655.278000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rm913"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d45d31c8-2426-4475-823c-a382105cd3ef","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なお、生成時に0とOとか1とlとIとかは除外してくれるやつ使う方が無難ですな","ts":"1617274251.277900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8sJAz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d42bc0a-b4c4-4a75-a86b-f928a7f28aac","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"どうしても手入力のときの話で、そうするとショルダーハック対策にもなるという(ただし打つのも辛くなるw)","ts":"1617274219.277200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pY0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac3502d2-e16d-425c-96e6-1f1a798d5503","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"自動生成して覚えないのが1番","ts":"1617274209.276900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QUGYu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35327e33-1980-457e-b345-54e82255d22b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"パスワードは覚えられるくらい短いの使っちゃダメというのがネットに詳しい人達の認識なのになぁ。","ts":"1617274166.276400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jkr3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b242fd4-4ecc-4821-8332-48d8cba370b5","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"webviewかと思ってました","ts":"1617274069.276300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jsz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a52adf01-a17b-4871-8928-69edb673133b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"さらに悪い事に、ネットに詳しくない人って Yahoo! ブラウザを使いたがるんですよね。あれパスワードマネージャが付いてはいるけど長いパスワード生成する機能が無しいし端末間で共有しないから、ユーザは辞書攻撃されかねない短い記憶できるパスワードを使うしかなくなるんですよね。","ts":"1617274013.276000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ibe2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c499ad95-007f-4382-9fcf-7bce5537e028","type":"message","us